# HP39gs Stock Font Gallery through the original APLET UI and serial disk.
# The first ENTER starts the lazy HPGCC/APLET transfer; host-gate resumes the
# launch only after Kermit has successfully completed LIB275L.
2000 tap f6
4000 tap f6
7000 tap aplet
8000 capture aplet-library
9000 tap f5
10000 capture receive-menu
10500 tap down
11200 tap down
11900 tap down
12600 tap down
12900 capture receive-serial-disk
13300 tap enter
13800 host-gate directory
0 capture remote-aplet
1500 tap enter
3000 capture lazy-fetch
4000 host-gate

# Times below are relative to host-gate release. Kermit transaction completion proves delivery but
# Stock may still be committing the aplet/library or unwinding the serial-disk
# UI. Use the same sparse launch-only ENTER retries as canonical Runtime. The
# harness cancels pending retries as soon as Gallery publishes its 0x47... state,
# so normal Gallery ENTER/DOWN/RIGHT navigation remains deterministic.
0 monitor 115000
500 capture fetch-complete
1000 retry enter
11000 retry enter
21000 retry enter
31000 retry enter
46000 retry enter
61000 retry enter

70000 capture native-mini
73000 tap enter
76000 capture native-mini-other
79000 tap down
82000 capture native-main
85000 tap enter
88000 capture native-main-other
91000 tap down
94000 capture native-editline
97000 tap enter
100000 capture native-editline-other
103000 tap right
106000 capture generated-control
109000 tap on
